        "answer": {
          "short": "80 lollipops",
          "worked": "For $n=25$:\n$$\\begin{align*}3n+5&=3\\times25+5\\\\3n+5&=75+5\\\\3n+5&=80\\end{align*}$$\nThere are 80 lollipops.",
